light at the ghost slows it down and limits its field of vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Claws</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By lunging forward, the ghost can phase through walls, hide inside objects and kill human players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Light Switches </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The light switches inside rooms control the light inside of those rooms. Turning the switch on lights up the room. You better scram when the switch is turned off! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 \tProximity Voice Chat </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The voices of other players will originate from their position. More realistic communication, more exciting plans... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Escaping From The House </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humans need to find items inside the house and bring them to the outer door in a certain order. Humans can use these items to open the door and escape the house.</p>",
    "short_description": "V Lights is a 2D multiplayer horror game with eye-catching graphics. Set strategic traps on your opponent with items, light controls, and dash time.",
